Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:47:28 +1100
Subject: feat: Little Trainer is twice as easy as Junior, not all-or-nothing

Catching is no longer guaranteed on Little Trainer: a ball has five times the
original odds (Junior has two and a half), so common Pokemon are caught almost
every time, rare ones usually break free, and weakening one first helps. A
miss costs nothing: the free ball is never used up.

Opposing Pokemon deal 50% damage (was 60%); with the player's 150% that is
twice Junior's edge in battle. Rival, Elite Four and Champion bring at most
three Pokemon (was four; Junior five). Experience is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNqSDphYuD2Aqe9TExdQMP

